### Contoh

```java run
import java.io.*;
import java.util.*;

public class Main {
    public static void main(String[] args) throws IOException {
        File laci = new File("laporan");
        laci.mkdirs();
        for (String bulan : new String[]{"mei", "januari", "maret"}) {
            try (PrintWriter w = new PrintWriter(new FileWriter(new File(laci, bulan + ".txt")))) {
                w.println("Laporan " + bulan);
            }
        }
        String[] isi = laci.list();
        Arrays.sort(isi);
        System.out.println("Folder? " + laci.isDirectory());
        System.out.println(Arrays.toString(isi));
    }
}
```

`new File(laci, bulan + ".txt")` menyusun alamat `laporan/mei.txt` tanpa perlu menulis garis miring sendiri.

